WEBVTT

00:15:26.613 --> 00:15:30.938
(Applause)

00:15:31.645 --> 00:15:34.654
So in the end, what is it
that we see, actually?

00:15:34.678 --> 00:15:38.761
What we see is that creativity has no age.

00:15:38.785 --> 00:15:40.987
Productivity does, right?

00:15:41.424 --> 00:15:45.559
Which is telling me that
at the end of the day,

00:15:45.583 --> 00:15:47.583
if you keep trying --

00:15:47.607 --> 00:15:50.010
(Laughter)

00:15:50.034 --> 00:15:53.606
you could still succeed
and succeed over and over.

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:56.021
So my conclusion is very simple:

00:15:56.045 --> 00:15:58.138
I am off the stage, back in my lab.

00:15:58.162 --> 00:15:59.333
Thank you.

00:15:59.357 --> 00:16:02.666
(Applause)